  "_combinesNote": "Ungated on purpose. The repeat that asks how many other people there are, and what they are called, belongs to DV-100; the packet merges the two declarations of it and keeps the first, so the three details only CLETS has boxes for were never asked at all. They are collected here instead, one question per person. A gate would have to name an option, and the thing that decides whether a person exists is their name - a text box, which has none."
